Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:05.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三分鐘，一個作品，說服整間教室。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:05.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three minutes. One project. Win over the whole room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}在 ACE，做出來只是一半；讓別人願意投資你，才是另一半。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}At ACE, building it is only half the job. Getting people to back it is the other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}當天每個人會拿到一個信封，裡面有多少資本，只有你自己知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:18.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Everyone gets an envelope. Only you know how much capital is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}聽完所有發表，把錢投給你最看好的作品。唯一的規則：不能投給自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:26.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After every pitch, invest in the project you believe in. One rule: never your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:31.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}募資最高的人，獨得 Claude Team Premium 一個月。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:31.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The top-funded founder wins one month of Claude Team Premium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}ACE Pitch Day，十月十五日，社課見。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:36.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}ACE Pitch Day. October 15. See you there.
